{"product_id":"the-250-eldercare-questions-everyone-should-ask","title":"The 250 Eldercare Questions Everyone Should Ask","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis book will answer all the financial and legal questions that can arise when caring for the elderly, including:\u003cbr\u003e\nHow do you plan for the management of the elder’s affairs should he become incompetent in the future?\u003cbr\u003e\nIs the proper insurance being carried or can it be restructured to reduce expenses?\u003cbr\u003e\nHow much money can I give my elders without impacting government aid?\u003cbr\u003e\nWhat are the goals of estate tax planning?\u003cbr\u003e\nThese questions and more will be answered in the comprehensive 250 Questions format. Whether you are caring full- or part-time for an aging parent, friend, or neighbor, you'll find all the answers you need in this compact guide.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:13 x 216  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Lita Epstein \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781598698909 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44698058457241,"sku":"16RA-3-9781598698909","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/4ebb34f5d4d5e7391a6a671554767896.jpg?v=1722429586","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-250-eldercare-questions-everyone-should-ask","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}